KnowItAll language packs

The language packs and dictionaries in this repository's releases are licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

They are adapted from the following sources; the changes made are listed in README.md and in the
release notes of each pack and dictionary.

- FrequencyWords (OpenSubtitles 2018, English 50k) (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords), Hermit Dave; word counts from the OpenSubtitles 2018 corpus of OPUS (P. Lison and J. Tiedemann, opensubtitles.org). License: CC BY-SA 4.0.
- wink-lemmatizer 3.0.4 and wink-lexicon 2.2.0 (https://github.com/winkjs/wink-lemmatizer), GRAYPE Systems Private Limited; wink-lexicon includes data from fnTBL (Johns Hopkins University, Radu Florian and Grace Ngai). License: MIT.
- WordNet 3.0 (https://wordnet.princeton.edu/), Princeton University. License: WordNet 3.0 License.
- SCOWL en_US Hunspell dictionary 2020.12.07 (dictionary-en 4.0.0) (http://wordlist.aspell.net/), Kevin Atkinson and SCOWL contributors; packaged by Titus Wormer. License: MIT AND BSD (SCOWL license).
- FrequencyWords (OpenSubtitles 2018, Polish 50k) (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords), Hermit Dave; word counts from the OpenSubtitles 2018 corpus of OPUS (P. Lison and J. Tiedemann, opensubtitles.org). License: CC BY-SA 4.0.
- SGJP, Grammatical Dictionary of Polish (Morfeusz 2 dump of 2026-01-04) (https://sgjp.pl/), Marcin Woliński, Zbigniew Bronk, Włodzimierz Gruszczyński, Witold Kieraś, Zygmunt Saloni, Danuta Skowrońska, Robert Wołosz. License: BSD-2-Clause.
- English Wiktionary (kaikki.org extract of 2026-10-30) (https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/), English Wiktionary contributors; extracted with Wiktextract by Tatu Ylonen and published by kaikki.org. License: CC BY-SA 4.0.

The notices of all sources are reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt; every pack and dictionary
also carries its own sources' notices in its metadata.
